; One cave block with a fixed entrance (d1), an unfixed entrance (d3), a
; fixed station that is no entrance (d4) and a plain station (d2), for the
; solved-entrance tests. d4's fix sits where its leg puts it.
*begin doghill
*fix d1 0 0 0
*fix d4 0 10 -5
*entrance d1
*entrance d3
*data normal from to tape compass clino
d1 d2 10.0 0 0
d2 d3 10.0 90 0
d2 d4 5.0 0 -90
*end doghill
